5. On-Board Computer: The On-Board Computer controls and monitors the operation of a CubeSat. It interacts with all other subsystems to manage their functions, process data, and execute commands.
6. Structure: The structure provides physical support for all components of a CubeSat. It interacts with all other subsystems to ensure proper integration, alignment, and protection from environmental factors such as radiation and temperature fluctuations.
